      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a very unusual way to put it. Regarding the density, can you expand more on how rapid changes in both factors simultaneously might lead to erratic readings in the AUV's salinity profile? I'm seeing some spikes in the data that don't seem to line up with the temperature shifts.",
